WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.389 --> 00:00:02.769
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.370
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.139
And now let's get to the news.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.674
The Biden administration
is set to announce

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:11.911
that Americans should receive
a coronavirus booster shot

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.147
eight months after
being fully vaccinated.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:17.383
So, if you got your second shot
in March,

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.618
you'd have to get your booster
right around the time

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:22.088
we re-invade Afghanistan.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.790
Former President Trump
appeared last night

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.091
on Sean Hannity's show.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.859
Yeah, no kidding.

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:28.795
At this point,
it's as newsworthy

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:31.530
as Sean Hannity appeared
on "Sean Hannity."

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.032
I'm surprised
he's not organizing

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:35.101
the office softball league.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.470
It was announced yesterday
that Texas Governor Greg Abbott

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.106
had tested positive
for a breakthrough case
of the coronavirus.

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.575
Now, I would never wish ill
on the governor,

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:45.545
but since he never wore a mask,
I don't have to.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:48.782
United Airlines reportedly sent
a memo to flight attendants

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.384
that asked them
to avoid using duct tape

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:54.354
as a measure to restrain
unruly passengers.

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.255
And so did Spirit Airlines,
saying,

00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:59.592
"Stop wasting it.
We need it to fix the wings."

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:02.295
The Washington Football Team
has reportedly

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:05.865
narrowed down the options for
new names down to three choices.

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:08.568
Oh, my God, who cares
what it's called?

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.470
Buffalo's football team
is the Bills,

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.071
and Buffalo Bill
was born in Denver.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:14.006
Nothing matters.
Call it anything.

00:01:14.006 --> 00:01:16.209
Go down to the zoo
and pick an animal or something.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:19.178
Hey, otters are cute.
Washington Otters -- done.

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:21.347
I can't believe we're going to
be out of Afghanistan

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:24.650
before you pick a team name
to miss the playoffs with.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:27.287
Health officials in Los Angeles
announced yesterday

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:30.023
that masks must be worn
at large outdoor events

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:31.924
that attract over 10,000 people,

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:34.894
or, as it's known in L.A.,
an exit.

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:38.430
And finally, Drake recently
revealed in an Instagram comment

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:41.500
that he had the coronavirus and
said it had caused hair loss.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.804
Said Drake, "It started from
the bottom, now it's here."

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:47.107
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:50.877
What was that?
Oh, the monologue.

